    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よーし、一暴れよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alright, time to cut loose!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あははっ！\u3000ヴァレリア、張り切ってるね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahaha! You're really fired up, Valeria!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あたしも負けてらんない！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I can't let you show me up!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おい。暴れすぎて船を壊すなよ？\n大事なモンがどっさり積んであるんだからよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey now. Don't go wrecking the ship with your enthusiasm.\nWe've got a lot of precious cargo on board."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "頂獣と戦うために色々準備してきましたからね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We've prepared all sorts of things for fighting the Apexi, after all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その通りだ！\u3000お前らが暴れすぎて壊れでもしたら、\n作戦がパーだからな！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Exactly! If you break any of it while going wild,\nthe whole plan goes up in smoke!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "特に、燃料が入ったたるには気を付けろよ！\n下手に引火したら丸焼けになるぞ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And watch those fuel barrels especially!\nOne wrong spark and we'll all be toast!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
